==Notes==
* When zooming out viewing the female armor, the dye on the dress will always have red accents, regardless of the color of the dye applied.
* The earrings on the female armor have clipping issues with some hairstyles.
* The Female version of this armor seems to be a reskin of [[Mesmer Elite Noble armor|Female Mesmer Elite Noble]] armor. The male seems to be a reskin of [[Mesmer Enchanter armor|Enchanter]] armor.
